# PuTTY
# website: https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~sgtatham/putty/
# docs: https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~sgtatham/putty/docs.html
# description: Terminal emulator and SSH client ignoring private keys, random seed files, and session logs.

# Private keys
*.ppk

# Cryptographic random seed files
putty.rnd
PUTTY.RND

# Terminal session logs
putty.log
PUTTY.LOG